    "description": "This NCEI Accession includes discrete sample and profile data collected during the R/V Knorr KN199-04, GEOTRACES-2010 cruise (EXPOCODE 316N20101015) in the North Atlantic Ocean from 2010-10-15 to 2010-11-05. These data include CTD temperature, salinity, oxygen and nutrients. The instruments used to collect these data include CTD, Niskin bottles and spectrophotometer.",
